---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { AREAS } from '../data/areas';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Services"
  description="Three ways to work together: the program (free diagnostic, half-day workshop, guided implementation), custom projects, and freelance analytics."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
        <h1 class="h2-size">Three ways to work together</h1>
        <p class="sub">
          Most teams start with the program. If your work doesn't fit it, send
          us a proposal.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <article class="prose">
        <div class="service-head" id="program">
          <h2>1. The program</h2>
          <span class="badge badge-open">Open now</span>
        </div>
        <ol class="ladder">
          <li>
            <strong>Free diagnostic and discovery call.</strong> Pick an area.
            Colleen runs the diagnostic and walks you through it.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Half-day workshop: $4,500.</strong> A pre-work audit, a
            half-day working session, and a written plan within 48 hours.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Guided implementation.</strong> A set number of months with
            a clear outcome. We scope the price after the workshop. What you
            leave with:
            <ul>
              {AREAS.map((a) => <li><strong>{a.name}:</strong> {a.outcome}</li>)}
              <li>
                Every engagement ends with governance and training, so your team
                owns the work.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Check-ins: $1,000/month.</strong> Optional. Every two weeks,
            after implementation.
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Book a discovery call →</a></p>

        <div class="service-head" id="custom">
          <h2>2. Custom projects</h2>
          <span class="badge">Accepting proposals</span>
        </div>
        <p>For work that doesn't fit the program. For example:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Content-first redesign oversight: we handle the inventory, structure,
            labels, governance, and measurement plan while your designer or
            developer builds.
          </li>
          <li>Martech vendor selection</li>
          <li>Data science projects</li>
        </ul>
        <p><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact?type=custom">Send a proposal →</a></p>

        <div class="service-head" id="freelance">
          <h2>3. Freelance engagements</h2>
          <span class="badge">Waitlist</span>
        </div>
        <p>
          Hands-on analytics work, embedded with your team, when capacity opens
          up. Join the waitlist and we'll reach out with honest timing.
        </p>
        <p><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact?type=freelance">Join the waitlist →</a></p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
